        "original_id": "4cb71cf8-2187-5ea2-8d96-f16b2339d924",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Johnny Pacar, Aly Michalka, Alessandra Torresani, Ambyr Childers, Toby Hemingway, Jonathan Keltz, Jennifer Missoni, Christian Slater\n- Products: Flight 29 Down, Make It or Break It, Now You See It..., American Dreams, Playback\n- Roles: Cody Jackson, Damon Young, Jimmy Francis, Allyson\n- Topics: acting, television, film, music\n\nFacts:\n- Johnny Pacar was born Johnny Edward Pacuraru on June 6, 1981.\n- Johnny Pacar is an American film and television actor and musician of partial Romanian descent.\n- Johnny Pacar is best known for playing Cody Jackson in the television series Flight 29 Down.\n- Johnny Pacar is best known for playing Damon Young in the ABC Family television series Make It or Break It.\n- Johnny Pacar starred in the Disney Channel Original Movie Now You See It....\n- Now You See It... is a 2005 Disney Channel Original Movie.\n- Now You See It... is told from Allyson's point of view, and Allyson is played by Aly Michalka.\n- Johnny Pacar had a recurring role as Jimmy Francis in American Dreams.\n- The film Playback stars Alessandra Torresani, Ambyr Childers, Johnny Pacar, Toby Hemingway, Jonathan Keltz, Jennifer Missoni, and Christian Slater.",
